  "prefLabel": "Ath 406.08 Obligation to Retain Evidence of Continuing Education",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ath 406.08 Obligation to Retain Evidence of Continuing Education. Licensees shall retain documentation of their continuing professional education and professional activities for at least 3 years.\n\nSource. #9976, eff 8-20-11; renumbered by #10228, (from Ath 405.09); renumbered by #10921 (from Ath 406.09); ss by #12069, eff 12-21-16; ss by #14247, eff 5-16-25, EXPIRES: 5-16-35",
